Our general objective is to empower Indigenous and Low Resource speakers.

In order to deliver on our promises we adhere to best practice, including the 
Universal Guidelines for AI, issued by the Center for AI and Digital Policy.

The person responsible for bezoku is Ian Gilmour, who can be contacted on ian.gilmour@bezoku.ai.

Our certification process for the prescribed public safety and related initiatives is 
work in progress, with updates issued in this github folder.
